        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-SQPULL24-622, Square 24 Inch Matte Black Ladder Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 24 Inch Matte Black Square Ladder Pull is very versatile. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. It has a 14-3/8 inch center to center. The powder coated Matte Black finish with the square design makes this pull feel very modern. Since it is made out of stainless steel tubing and has a durable powder coated finish, this 2 Foot Door Pull is made to last.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SQPULL24-specifications.gif?v=1704354526\" width=\"485\" height=\"165\" boarder=\"0\" alt=\"DWDSQULL24-622 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in <a href=\"/products/24-inch-oil-rubbed-bronze-square-ladder-pull-dwd-sqpull24-613\"><b>Oil Rubbed Bronze Finish</b></a> and \r\n<br>\r\nOther Lengths \r\n<a href=\"/products/matte-black-36-inch-square-ladder-pull-dwd-sqpull36-622\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a> or \r\n<a href=\"/products/48-inch-matte-black-square-ladder-pull-dwd-sqpull48-622\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD SQULL24-622 Contemporary Matte Black Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 24\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 14-3/8\" (365 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-3/16\" (32 mm) Square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "24 Inch Matte Black Square Ladder Pull, DWD-SQPULL24-622",
                "description": "24 Inch Matte Black Square Ladder Pull - The 24 Inch Matte Black Square Ladder Pull is very versatile. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. It has a 14-3/8 inch center to center. The Matte Black finish with the square design makes this pull feel very modern. Since it is made out of stainless steel tubing, this 2 Foot Door Pull is made to last.\r\n",
